rawrmage <rawrnix@rawrnix.com> wrote:
> Hello NetHack and variant players!
>
> This is an announcement of the NetHack Summer Tournament this year!
>
> This is the first of the (hopefully) annual summer tournament series. 
>
> This tournament is not limited to NetHack, it also includes servers from 
> several variants including AceHack, UnNetHack, SporkHack and as a special 
> challenge to dedicated players NetHack 1.3d. 

The list of supported public servers is at
http://junethack.rawrnix.com/servers

We're using public data (xlogfiles and rc-files) from the existing
public servers so you can most likely play on your favorite public
servers.

This also means that all your games during the tournament are counted
even if you register late and have started and finished games before
registering.

> This tournament starts at 12:00 AM UTC on Sunday July 17th and runs until 
> the end of August 14th UTC. [...]

To clarify, that means it starts tonight at midnight UTC.

